      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WebP：成熟普及・規格較受限",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WebP：老態龍鍾・不符現代攝影需求",
      "lineHeight": 1.32
    },
    {
      "id": "t_webp_d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 433,
      "width": 496.46999999999986,
      "height": 34.32,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#475569",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 763,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 776,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 源自 VP8，以 8-bit 為主且無原生 HDR\n• 適合一般網頁小縮圖，不適合作為高動態攝影典藏",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 源自 VP8，僅支援 8-bit 色深與 4:2:0 色度抽樣，完全不支援 HDR 與廣色域\n• 適合一般網頁小縮圖，若用於風景與人像攝影典藏則容易出現色階斷層",
      "lineHeight": 1.32
    },
